_paragraph\" >Take a picture with viewers! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Capture memories in photos that will last a lifetime!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900420/extras/d19498e6675afee94c6c33811d6115d3.avif?t=1760101001\" width=622 height=582 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer : </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mouse and keyboard to use spells.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Chat Viewer :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Command : &quot;Join&quot; to join game</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1/2/3 : Spawn a unit to each number's position.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key Feature :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-streamer-only game. Twitch, YouTube, Chzzk supports.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Fast paced realtime strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Various unique events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Photo mode.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2900420?t=1760101001","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2900420?t=1760101001","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900420/846b2a31eaada879996567a50fd1bd44ab43821d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760101001","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2900420/846b2a31eaada879996567a50fd1bd44ab43821d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760101001","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Marriage Impossible!  is a real time strategy game playable for a streamer with 45~ v